{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_049_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fe29391d18f6422c873651b047ca454cb43d5b782d34d2d50acf7c6340c6c045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe1c67c1c6e19aeec55993446dacafcf0093788bd1da14511dbab5093e3bab3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我是来送情人节回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1975761f75686fe795013628fb091bd437a3f43af0976b871ea6956860756fcd",
      "text": "就是这个，收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2e046efc3ba9a2848a9fa71dbce0ee244a66a52838dbfec57bf93d237a0c951",
      "text": "因为你之前说过没什么特别的要求，\n我便凭借自己的判断挑选了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21643cf8c62dbad361e9ff9ee4cfb7205ad6e057fabef91cbe877f6ee1720ef1",
      "text": "另外，收到的巧克力味道很棒。\n特意挑选了我喜欢的口味啊，真让我吃惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65cfcabe92b9c91c3e7c3cf9604236fbc861b555bed9c70d3c8f8e3fabc63b1c",
      "text": "请允许我再次向你致谢。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd87a99ae95e47ec1a98129182689fe2bb82bb138010fd4be2cb76fbd43cdf61",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这是情人节的回礼，请收下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a4eec40c9950a355861e42ede1de5ed69f4f4b3303a431ce4fec011aa4fdc61",
      "text": "……我先道个歉吧。对不起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ef9c7957fbe2fba28b988f789aa048217175b4805354aa4f7923604509267f",
      "text": "我本以为自己在挑选这类礼物上应当挺擅长的，\n但这一次却没能处理得尽善尽美。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef545c33bc4d3040f71cd4df487b9dc4ce930db999177da6f31428e256e2c7e",
      "text": "想送一份配得上那盒巧克力的礼物，想传达平日里的感激之情。\n希望能让你高兴，想让你发出惊叹……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afc4f53edad86847c187403ac4ad8f81582201720b54dc0c2055ef049dacb412",
      "text": "为了你想要达成的心愿实在太多，\n导致思绪陷入了混乱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6c630502bb37ab0b96838f70dec82f2bd21c4db3164510f58eb24a2f198c23c",
      "text": "……看着礼物候选方案像个孩子一样，\n觉得这个不对那个也不好，犹豫不决了很久。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d23ce663b6e7a90f5a22245112893b1287630446d045f6c685bad7f106eaf8e",
      "text": "但愿这里面哪怕能达成其中一个目标就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56810dd416e0dea4083a015e59c1c6431b92df50c3b6e131f572650cd805cf9",
      "text": "心意我已经充分感受到了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000052:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede0b40149741a03007cb064466e7ec30d48e8f923de21dbb9143f02514ee6d8",
      "text": "全部都已经达成了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb3e14906e991fd43d20de88805de46e5e6a933b3030eb72c05258d8374f1c40",
      "text": "这样啊。……不过通过这件事，\n我又有一处不成熟的缺点暴露无遗了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_22:5_02_049_22_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fe9e3dbc0112a9d1e520743e50f37a9f1a7c5a1c3b02a4162d8a153a248f7e1",
      "text": "今后为了我的成长，\n也请借我一臂之力。拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
